Quoting  Red Bandit  <redbandit@gmail.com>:
>One of the levels I effectively skipped was a swamp. I have a single,
>lonely uncursed potion of levitation. Is this sufficient to explore a
>swamp of indeterminate size safely?

It has no effect on your ability to explore it safely. You can't levitate
with an eel wrapped around you.

Use telepathy to find the eels; kill them with thrown rocks. Follow the
simple rule that you will never step next to the water when any eel is
alive. Eels are not randomly generated, so once they're gone, they're
gone.

Some items (like the oilskin cloak) do provide a perfect defence, but
personally I recommend trying to keep good habits if possible.
